	"data": "ThoughtBubbles → Core System: Cross-Pollination Map\n\n\"You were building the same instincts from both sides — the user-facing side and the system-facing side. The bridge is Core.\"\n\nWhat This Is\n\nA mapping of ThoughtBubbles design concepts to Core System architecture. The insight: ThoughtBubbles was always the application design of something that also exists as a platform design. Every TB concept has a runtime analog. Core is Mind-OS as infrastructure. ThoughtBubbles is Mind-OS as…",
